    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Days 8–11 · Free days on the tropical coast of Búzios. A former fishing village about 170 km (105 miles) from Rio, Búzios has more than 20 magnificent beaches, crystal-clear water, beautiful landscapes, exotic vegetation and summer weather almost all year, with a unique combination of rustic charm, architectural harmony, sophisticated boutiques and restaurants that welcome travellers from all over the world. Try a different beach every day: the eastern beaches, on the Atlantic side, are windier and ideal for sports, while the western beaches offer calmer, warmer water for swimming and sunbathing.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "dfc6afe545c94eaf23fea14fec462e2852cc934778fbdd4c8020123e78681dda",
      "provenance": {
